│                                                                    │
│ The core issue is that the RadioSelect widget is incorrectly       │
│ rendering a "-------" option when blank=False for a ForeignKey     │
│ field. This happens because the widget doesn't properly handle the │
│ case where a valid value exists, and it defaults to showing the    │
│ "blank" option. The fix is to prevent the RadioSelect widget from  │
│ rendering the "-------" option when a valid value exists. This can │
│ be achieved by conditionally suppressing the rendering of the      │
│ empty option.                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Patch:                                                             │
│                                                                    │
